ginalImage","label","创作者原图","items",[66],{"_62":63,"_25":67},"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0045cc0c-b7c0-4c99-be13-c13f2c66cef2","text","mediaReviewed","截图来源核查","value","2026-10-20","language","en","image","gameplay","The creator’s in-game title screen and supermarket scene; this is not a GameMap execution of the Windows release.","src","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/supermarket-simulator-cursor.webp","alt","The creator’s running supermarket game at its title menu, showing store shelves and two characters.","https://github.com/breineng/supermarket-simulator#description","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","Creator-published screenshot","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型",[93],"Cursor","相关资源",[98],"resourceIds","section",{"_62":99,"_25":100},"Unity · Manual","/zh/resources/unity-engine/","创作者开发记录",[104],"evidence",{"_62":105,"_25":82,"_106":107},"查看作者的 AI 使用说明","note","Author README names coding models, Hunyuan assets, source setup and a linked creation video. Source-checked; full reproduction not performed.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[112],{"_62":113,"_25":114,"_106":115},"查看完整游戏项目","https://github.com/breineng/supermarket-simulator","Complete Unity 2023.2.6f1 project with Assets, Packages and ProjectSettings. Scenes, prefabs and models use Git LFS: clone with LFS and run git lfs pull before opening Assets/Scenes/InitScene.unity. MIT code; Unity, generated models and dependencies retain their terms. LFS objects were not fetched in this review.","获取方式","download","demo","试玩与运行",[121],{"_62":122,"_25":123,"_106":124},"Download the Windows game","https://github.com/breineng/supermarket-simulator/releases/download/0.0.1/SupermarketSimulator.zip","Windows download, about 397 MB, from release 0.0.1. Extract and run Supermaket Simulator.exe. Other platforms require a source build; the binary was not downloaded or executed in this review.","游戏平台","GitHub Releases","指南形式","disclosure","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[132],{"_62":133,"_25":82,"_106":-7},"阅读作者的开发说明"